{"step_index":417,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T21:09:16Z","content":"The Sovra Native Compiler binary `ops/runtime/sovrac` is compiled!\n\nNow, let's create a `.sovra` test file that attempts a **FORBIDDEN UNGATED ASSIGNMENT** (`ops/runtime/invalid_test.sovra`) to prove that `sovrac` catches and rejects uncaught type coercions at the AST level!\n\nLet's write `ops/runtime/invalid_test.sovra`.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"// FORBIDDEN UNGATED ASSIGNMENT TEST FILE (.sovra)\n// Demonstrates that sovrac rejects raw candidate assignment to decision at AST type-checking level.\n\nfn test_uncaught_coercion() {\n    val raw_candidate: candidate<ToolCall> = model.infer(\"Run shell command\");\n    \n    // TYPE CHECKER REJECTION TRIGGER:\n    // Raw candidate assigned directly to decision WITHOUT gate block!\n    val illegal_decision: decision<ToolCall> = raw_candidate; \n}\n","Description":"Create invalid .sovra source file to test AST type checker rejection.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/ops/runtime/invalid_test.sovra","toolAction":"Creating invalid .sovra test file","toolSummary":"Write ops/runtime/invalid_test.sovra"}}]}
